1
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:24,460
We sigh whenever we're about to come to a standstill

2
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:24,460
Owarinaki tabi no tochuu tachidomarisouna toki

3
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:30,710
While moving on this endless journey.

4
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:30,710
Fukai tameiki kobosu bokura wa

5
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:38,430
Everytime we lunge for it, it escapes and flies off.

6
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:38,430
Tsukamikaketewa mata hanareteitta

7
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:45,850
But now, there's nothing to be afraid of

8
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:45,850
Demo ima wa mou nanimo osoreru koto wa nai

9
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:53,780
The powerful ties that bind our hearts

10
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:53,780
Kokoro wo tsunagu tsuyoi kizuna wa

11
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:59,240
Will never come loose.

12
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:59,240
Keshite hodoke wa shinai sa

13
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:08,960
After a lifetime of searching, we finally arrived

14
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:08,960
Sagashitsuzukete tadoritsuita

15
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,760
Here, where the period lies.

16
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,760
Kono basho de piriodo ni

17
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:24,060
Let's change all our sorrow and rage to power.

18
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:24,060
Kanashimi ikari chikara ni kaete

19
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:28,980
Destiny is right within our reach.

20
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:28,980
Unmei wa sugu soba ni

21
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The Oath in the Tunnel

22
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The Oath in the Tunnel

23
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:48,040
Geez, I've died...

24
00:01:48,330 --> 00:01:50,330
...so many times because of you!

25
00:01:57,130 --> 00:01:58,970
That was close!

26
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,520
Young master!

27
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,650
Save the reunion for later!

28
00:02:12,650 --> 00:02:13,560
Let's finish this up!

29
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,360
Roger!

30
00:02:15,650 --> 00:02:18,570
Just let me eat you already!

31
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:28,620
What a one-sided battle!

32
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:32,380
I had no idea you were hiding such a fine woman from me.

33
00:02:32,380 --> 00:02:34,420
Quite the playboy, are we?

34
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:36,250
Thank you kindly!

35
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:41,090
How in the world can you tell where I am...

36
00:02:41,380 --> 00:02:45,140
...when it's so pitch dark out here?

37
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:18,420
The Emperor of Xing moves our nation by manipulating the veins of the dragon,

38
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:22,930
in other words, the flow of energy.

39
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:30,270
We, who serve him, can also read the flow.

40
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:34,230
Additionally, by virtue of our office, we can see well in the dark.

41
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:37,360
That voice...

42
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:42,860
It's been a while, kid.

43
00:03:44,490 --> 00:03:46,660
So it is  you, Old Man Fu!

44
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:47,910
Why are you here?

45
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:49,410
How did you know where we were?

46
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:54,250
We were lurking in Central for a bit to figure out what was going on,

47
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:58,340
and we sensed a few substantial energy forms headed in this direction.

48
00:03:58,340 --> 00:03:59,800
So we followed them.

49
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:04,300
There are two large energy forms clashing right over there, too.

50
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,840
I think those are Greed and Gluttony.

51
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:09,180
Greed...!

52
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:12,060
The one who took over the young master's body?!

53
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:18,520
There's also one in the woods.

54
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:22,280
A friend of ours is fighting a homunculus named Pride right now.

55
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,240
Right.

56
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:26,820
And lastly,

57
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:31,790
there's something within the nearby village that can't even be compared to the rest.

58
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,500
That's probably Ed's old man.

59
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:35,960
Him?!

60
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:39,920
Is your father not human?!

61
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,380
We can leave him be for now.

62
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:46,300
Gotta do something about the homunculi first.

63
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,680
Don't worry about Gluttony.

64
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:50,970
We can leave him to Lan Fan.

65
00:04:51,260 --> 00:04:53,220
"Leave him to Lan Fan"...?

66
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:58,770
It's only been half a year since she got her automail attached!

67
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:01,110
That's reckless, old man!

68
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:03,480
We need to help her, or she's dead meat!

69
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,040
What the hell?!

70
00:05:18,290 --> 00:05:19,540
Don't worry about her.

71
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:22,290
Martial arts isn't our only weapon.

72
00:05:22,290 --> 00:05:24,300
If you're gonna blow stuff up, say so first!

73
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,840
What?!

74
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,050
Explosions?!

75
00:05:28,050 --> 00:05:28,880
What's going on?

76
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:29,550
Is it in the forest?

77
00:05:29,550 --> 00:05:30,590
Are lights not back on yet?

78
00:05:30,590 --> 00:05:32,050
Hey, bring a lamp!

79
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:36,640
Geez...

80
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:40,730
In that case, I guess I can rest assured.

81
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:46,530
Old Man Fu, what else do you guys have aside from explosives?

82
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:48,530
A lot of stuff.

83
00:05:48,530 --> 00:05:51,410
Tear gas, flash bangs, and flares.

84
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:57,370
The people in the slums are beginning to turn on lights.

85
00:05:58,500 --> 00:06:00,540
Those shadows will start to appear again.

86
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:03,040
If we don't hurry, Heinkel will be in trouble!

87
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,750
Exactly.

88
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:08,970
Old Man Fu, could you take me to where Pride is?

89
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:12,640
There's something I want you to help out with.

90
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:21,310
Roger that.

91
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:22,690
Ed!

92
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,440
Don't let your guard down.

93
00:06:27,150 --> 00:06:30,200
Pride, the one that Heinkel's fighting...

94
00:06:57,220 --> 00:07:00,230
Just die already...

95
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:23,170
It's just as you said, little Roy.

96
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:28,090
Selim Bradley is not human.

97
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,670
These photographs are quite old.

98
00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:33,970
Twenty years ago...

99
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:37,180
And this one's from fifty years ago.

100
00:07:38,470 --> 00:07:41,390
No matter what era, he's always near important government officials.

101
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:48,820
I also checked the town where the Führer President was supposedly born in.

102
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:53,110
Although there are documents that show he grew up there,

103
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:57,070
not a single soul has seen the Bradley family there before.

104
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:01,000
The mansion located at the address was also a fake.

105
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,910
Of course, no relatives either.

106
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:08,630
Thank you, Madam Christmas.

107
00:08:09,250 --> 00:08:11,550
You must have been through a lot to gather all this information.

108
00:08:11,550 --> 00:08:12,920
You bet.

109
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:17,720
But the moment I found out Selim wasn't human,

110
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:20,560
all my fatigue just flew away.

111
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,810
But then...

112
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:26,230
...I wonder why nobody noticed before?

113
00:08:27,810 --> 00:08:32,480
He's the son of the man who stands at the top of this militaristic nation, even nicknamed 'King'.

114
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:36,240
Fabricating a tale is like a walk in the park.

115
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:52,510
Y-You little...!

116
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,340
Hey!

117
00:08:53,670 --> 00:08:54,720
Who is it?!

118
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:56,220
Is someone there?!

119
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,840
A monster!

120
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:02,140
Oh no!

121
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:03,020
A child is being attacked!

122
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,660
A monster!!

123
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:26,790
Shit!

124
00:09:29,830 --> 00:09:33,300
Naturally, with this much light, there's plenty of shadow.

125
00:09:34,630 --> 00:09:37,010
Goodbye, mister chimera.

126
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:43,970
That was close, man.

127
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,020
Geez...

128
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:49,900
I still can't believe a brat like you was a homunculus.

129
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:53,360
You certainly had me going, Selim Bradley.

130
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,820
Appearances are only symbols.

131
00:09:58,650 --> 00:09:59,530
Isn't that right,

132
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:03,660
mister tiny alchemist?

133
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:16,300
Where is he?!

134
00:10:16,710 --> 00:10:18,130
Where's Roy Mustang?!

135
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:20,090
He's still inside.

136
00:10:20,090 --> 00:10:22,510
Been in there for a while,
considering how he goes there so often.

137
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:26,180
That woman, Madam Christmas...

138
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,770
Her real name is Chris Mustang.

139
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:30,310
His foster mother!

140
00:10:30,890 --> 00:10:31,690
Dammit!

141
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:42,200
Christ...

142
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,120
Look what happened to my castle...

143
00:10:44,950 --> 00:10:48,500
I'll buy another one for you soon, so forgive me.

144
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:53,830
In that case, I guess I can let it go.

145
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:56,460
I'm going to need to stay undercover for a while, too.

146
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:58,630
Are the girls from the shop safe?

147
00:10:58,630 --> 00:11:02,510
Don't worry, they should be in a foreign country by now.

148
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:07,310
They're probably having fun,
and I'm sure they've forgotten about you.

149
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:10,390
Moving right along...

150
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:15,150
Worry about yourself and this country's future for now.

151
00:11:21,990 --> 00:11:28,040
I won't forgive you if I meet you in a body bag as a traitor the next time I see you.

152
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,500
Thanks, Madam.

153
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,660
I'll definitely repay you.

154
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:35,330
Gonna repay the loan once you become successful, eh?

155
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:39,710
I guess I'll be looking forward to it this time, little Roy.

156
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:46,680
I'm not a kid anymore, you know...

157
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:52,270
Okay.

158
00:11:52,270 --> 00:11:53,770
Guess it's time for me to do my job too.

159
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:19,170
You're late, Colonel.

160
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:21,420
We were about to leave without you.

161
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:26,430
Your jabs make me feel right at home.

162
00:12:27,340 --> 00:12:28,720
No signs of being followed?

163
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:29,680
Nope.

164
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,520
If there were, he'd react to them right away.

165
00:12:34,270 --> 00:12:35,520
That's a good boy.

166
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:38,150
I'm counting on you!

167
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:41,820
Any movements from the Bradley family?

168
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:45,240
I've confirmed their plans for the next three days.

169
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:48,410
The Führer President is attending the joint practice in the east.

170
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:51,030
Selim is also with him.

171
00:12:51,740 --> 00:12:53,330
About that...

172
00:12:53,750 --> 00:12:56,790
The train that was carrying the Führer President plummeted down a valley.

173
00:12:58,250 --> 00:12:59,710
Wow...

174
00:12:59,710 --> 00:13:02,920
That old Grumman really knows how to be extreme.

175
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:05,920
With that, they'll start being a lot more cautious...

176
00:13:06,630 --> 00:13:09,300
That may make some things difficult for us.

177
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:11,350
Will that affect our mission?

178
00:13:11,970 --> 00:13:15,640
Will the Eastern Army come to Central as planned?

179
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:22,690
The Führer President is missing...

180
00:13:23,860 --> 00:13:28,820
The chance of a lifetime, or a trap to lure us in...

181
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:32,580
Even if it happens to be the latter, we have no choice but to proceed.

182
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,210
Please give us an order.

183
00:13:45,010 --> 00:13:49,510
What's in our hands right now is a one-way ticket to a battlefield.

184
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:54,470
No matter the outcome, we can't go back.

185
00:13:55,430 --> 00:14:01,150
The reason for that is because even after we complete our mission,

186
00:14:02,110 --> 00:14:06,320
you all have the grand task of rebuilding the nation by my side, after I become Führer President.

187
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:11,070
With that said, my only order for you all is this:

188
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:13,870
"Don't die!"

189
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,080
That is all!

190
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,210
Roger!

191
00:14:32,970 --> 00:14:34,140
Why...

192
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:35,430
Why won't it slice?

193
00:14:58,950 --> 00:15:02,830
Good thing I left my automail in its northern state.

194
00:15:03,790 --> 00:15:06,840
There's plenty of carbon fiber in it, after all.

195
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,050
Carbon reinforcement!

196
00:15:11,130 --> 00:15:13,180
Copying Greed, eh?

197
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:16,050
In that case...

198
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:32,900
What's wrong?

199
00:15:33,860 --> 00:15:35,450
Are you finished already?!

200
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:41,290
As originally planned...

201
00:15:50,710 --> 00:15:51,720
Al!

202
00:15:52,170 --> 00:15:57,600
...it's probably advantageous for me to fight using your little brother.

203
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,520
Old Man Fu!

204
00:16:09,650 --> 00:16:10,780
A flash bang?!

205
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,530
Curses!

206
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:16,910
I'm sick of those guys!

207
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:20,490
Huh?

208
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,510
What's wrong, Lan Fan?!

209
00:16:35,630 --> 00:16:36,510
Lan Fan!

210
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:41,310
Donkey Kong!

211
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:42,560
You got it!

212
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:50,690
Al!

213
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:54,490
Donkey Kong, you take Al and run.

214
00:16:54,490 --> 00:16:56,280
Isn't he still under Pride's influence?

215
00:16:56,910 --> 00:17:01,160
Parts that have been separated from
a homunculi's body disperse and cease to exist.

216
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:08,500
Since we separated Al from the source
of the shadow, Pride is no longer inside him.

217
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:10,710
I won't let you get away!

218
00:17:10,710 --> 00:17:11,880
Have another one!

219
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:15,970
Hey, what was that flash from earlier?

220
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,850
Ow! Ow!

221
00:17:26,850 --> 00:17:28,560
You're good.

222
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:34,820
You look pretty beat up.

223
00:17:35,150 --> 00:17:39,030
That woman and Greed are so strange!

224
00:17:39,030 --> 00:17:42,450
It's like they know where I am in the dark!

225
00:17:42,450 --> 00:17:43,620
What did you say?

226
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:52,170
They must be the warriors from Xing that Wrath was talking about.

227
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:54,250
The ones that can feel the presence of us homunculi.

228
00:17:55,590 --> 00:18:00,510
Greed must be using that ability after absorbing Xing's prince.

229
00:18:01,890 --> 00:18:03,140
Damn him...

230
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:10,020
Gluttony,

231
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,190
how many times did you die?

232
00:18:13,190 --> 00:18:15,280
I don't even know.

233
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,360
A lot.

234
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:21,110
I was beaten pretty badly as well.

235
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:25,660
At this rate, we may end up being annihilated by them.

236
00:18:26,870 --> 00:18:30,040
Then we can have Father fix us up-

237
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,500
Huh?

238
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:33,080
What?

239
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:37,960
No...

240
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,680
I don't like this, Pride.

241
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,400
No!

242
00:18:57,110 --> 00:18:58,650
Don't eat me!

243
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:00,820
That hurts...

244
00:19:00,820 --> 00:19:03,660
Help me... Lust...

245
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:27,260
He... ate his own comrade...!

246
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:30,270
Wow.

247
00:19:30,810 --> 00:19:32,890
This is convenient.

248
00:19:32,890 --> 00:19:36,060
It's quite simple to distinguish your scents.

249
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:40,610
Although the hunger that came with the ability seems like it'll be a pain.

250
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:41,990
Huh?

251
00:19:44,990 --> 00:19:46,620
This scent...

252
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:49,620
Are you nearby,

253
00:19:50,750 --> 00:19:52,210
Hohenheim?

254
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:15,230
The promise we never made

255
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:15,230
Kawashita hazu no nai yakasoku ga

256
00:20:15,230 --> 00:20:16,020
yet again

257
00:20:15,230 --> 00:20:16,020
Kyou mo

258
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:20,860
tries to snatch our future away from us.

259
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:20,860
Bokura no mirai wo ubaou to suru

260
00:20:22,490 --> 00:20:26,450
Why is it that we can't rejoice

261
00:20:22,490 --> 00:20:26,450
Hoshigatteita mono wo te ni shitemo

262
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:27,450
straight from the heart

263
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:27,450
Sunao ni

264
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:32,410
when we obtain something we've always been after?

265
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:32,410
Umaku waraenai nowa nazedarou

266
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:38,130
The overflowing tears aren't from feebleness or remorse.

267
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:38,130
Afureru namida wo yowasa ya koukai ja nai

268
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:42,920
They're fragments born from agony.

269
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:42,920
Itami ga unda kakera de

270
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:47,970
Of all the moments and destinies,

271
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:47,970
Donna shunkan datte unmei datte

272
00:20:47,970 --> 00:20:56,730
I realized there's one absolute certainty.

273
00:20:47,970 --> 00:20:56,730
Hitotsu dake tashika na mono ga aru to shitta

274
00:20:56,730 --> 00:20:59,270
Even if things get tough and I'm at my limit

275
00:20:56,730 --> 00:20:59,270
Genkai datte konnan datte

276
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:03,280
I refuse to give up.

277
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:03,280
Akirametakunaiyo

278
00:21:03,280 --> 00:21:08,160
Please, don't let go.

279
00:21:03,280 --> 00:21:08,160
Konomama hanasanaide

280
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:16,000
I can feel the warmth of your right hand

281
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:16,000
Kataku nigirishimeta kimi no migite no nukumori

282
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,670
where it's tightly joined with my left.

283
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,670
Koko ni arukara

284
00:21:30,350 --> 00:21:35,020
It appears as though Mustang is sneaking about with his old underlings.

285
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:44,820
If he has something to do with the train explosion and all the Ishbalans that have infiltrated Central...

286
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:49,030
Just when I thought things couldn't get any worse...

287
00:21:51,530 --> 00:21:57,660
You all must know his thoughts better than myself.

288
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:01,040
If you were him, what would you do next?

289
00:22:08,470 --> 00:22:13,810
If it were me, I'd get Madam Bradley in my hands first.

290
00:22:14,890 --> 00:22:16,980
Take her hostage?

291
00:22:17,930 --> 00:22:19,810
What a useless act.

292
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:28,530
Intentionally making himself seem like a traitor by taking a useless hostage, eh...

293
00:22:28,900 --> 00:22:32,820
Humans are so incorrigible.

294
00:22:55,430 --> 00:22:57,470
Hey, what are you doing?!

295
00:23:01,560 --> 00:23:02,810
Roy Mustang?!

296
00:23:20,250 --> 00:23:23,170
Sorry for causing trouble this late at night, Madam.

297
00:23:24,290 --> 00:23:26,090
Lieutenant Hawkeye!

298
00:23:26,090 --> 00:23:28,130
Why would someone like you do this?!

299
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:31,380
Pardon my rudeness.

300
00:23:31,970 --> 00:23:36,470
We have no intention of harming you if you don't resist.

301
00:23:46,190 --> 00:23:48,440
Please, come with us.

302
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:01,160
Memories.

303
00:24:01,870 --> 00:24:04,000
They are recollections of the heart.

304
00:24:05,130 --> 00:24:08,290
If those who are not human come to possess memories,

305
00:24:08,290 --> 00:24:10,960
people begin to fear the result.

306
00:24:12,470 --> 00:24:16,930
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

307
00:24:16,930 --> 00:24:20,950
Episode 49, Filial Affection.

308
00:24:16,950 --> 00:24:20,950
Filial Affection

309
00:24:21,390 --> 00:24:26,190
With each of their own thoughts in their chest, they see the daybreak.
